 "notes": [
  "Form 801 is the Offer Summary Document — a 1-page cover sheet the BUYING brokerage completes (mandatory in full) as evidence of a written signed offer; the LISTING brokerage completes the receiving section. It is NOT the Confirmation of Co-operation and Representation (that is OREA Form 320).",
  "No fillable 801 exists in the repo or publicly (OREA forms are member-only via WEBForms/PropTx); all 'blank' values are null. The direct-draw filler (fill_direct2.py pattern) only needs rects, so this map is still fillable.",
  "Date fragments (day/month/year pieces) and the outcome checkboxes are positioned from dotted-line runs; sub-day rects are approximate within ~10pt."
 ]
}